2. LANDMARK ILLUSTRATIONS  —  CC BY 4.0
   (js/placeArt.js, and the glyph library inside js/mugArt.js)

The 785 place illustrations and the fallback glyph library are original
artwork created for this project. They depict real-world landmarks; they are
not reproductions of any Starbucks product design, and they were not traced
or derived from any third-party photograph.

Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International.
