────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
3. MUG DATASET  —  factual data, CC0 / public domain dedication
   (js/data.js)

The list of which mugs exist (series, type, place) is factual information
compiled from the public sitemap of starbucks-mugs.com, which is gratefully
acknowledged as the source. Facts are not copyrightable; this compilation is
released under CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication) so other collectors can
reuse it freely.
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Coordinates, Chinese names and colour palettes were added by this project and
fall under the same CC0 dedication.

